n("fifty-routes-four-walls","obstruction","Four walls of the fifty-routes campaign","22 of 50 routes reduce to one of four walls: pointwise (averaged or modulus-only inputs carry no every-window information), verified height, flow-blindness (SL2-class soft hypotheses), RH-equivalence (object restates RH, GRH or the explicit formula). Other classes: method-cap, Euler-blind, consumes-zeros, measurement.","closed","no","no",SY,["antibridge","heat-flow","weil","explicit-formula"])
