n("lean-weil-small-support","tool","Lean: Yoshida-type small-support Weil positivity","Lean 4: prime side vanishes for supp g in [-b, b], b < log 2; F(f*f~) = |Ff|^2; uncertainty_toeplitz_nonneg (w >= m off [-T,T], deficit <= D, 2aD <= m gives int w |Ff|^2 >= 0). Model functional >= 0 for supp f in [-13/150, 13/150]. Explicit formula is a hypothesis over an abstract zero functional.","proved","no","yes",R("route-39-lean-weil-small-support-2026-10-14"),["lean","weil","explicit-formula"])
