n("heat-evolved-von-mangoldt-positivity","identity","Heat-evolved von Mangoldt coefficients stay nonnegative","Lean: with G_t(n) = exp(t log^2 n/4) and D = multiplication by log n (Leibniz for Dirichlet convolution), beta(t) is the unique solution of beta * G_t = D G_t; beta(0) = Lambda; 4 d beta_n/dt = log^2(n) beta_n + 2 sum_{de=n} beta_d (log e) beta_e; hence beta_n(t) >= 0 and nondecreasing on t >= 0.","proved","yes","yes",R("route-40-lean-wol-band-barrier-2026-10-14"),["heat-flow","euler-product","lean","mollifier"])
